``` CL-09 | Search Head Cluster Captain Election Churn
    Splunk Administrator Field Manual - Gaurav Malik

    Use case: SHC captaincy keeps moving between members, scheduled searches
    are being skipped during handoffs, and the cause of the elections needs to
    be found.
    Run on: SHC member.
    Query: Main query
    If this returns nothing, run probes/CL-09-probe.spl,
    probes/CL-09-probe-rest.spl to confirm the data it reads exists here.
    STATUS: lab verification pending; field or message names may differ on your version.
```
index=_internal sourcetype=splunkd earliest=-24h
    (component=SHCRaftConsensus OR component=SHCMaster OR component=SHCSlave)
    (elect* OR leader OR captain OR term OR vote)
| rex field=_raw "\]\s+-\s+(?<msg>.+)$"
| eval msg_sig=replace(replace(msg,"[0-9a-fA-F-]{16,}","GUID"),"\d+","N")
| bin _time span=15m
| stats count as events dc(host) as members_reporting
        values(msg_sig) as signatures by _time
| where events>0
| sort 0 _time
